{"id":"lit-pai-jiangchengzi","cat":"literature","type":"词牌","name":"词牌·江城子","era":"两宋","year":null,"endYear":null,"ptype":null,"birth":null,"death":null,"summary":"双调七十字，前后段各七句五平韵。又名《江神子》《村意远》。","tags":["苏轼","词牌","江城子"],"groups":[],"minor":false,"detail":"苏轼以《江城子》写悼亡与出猎，开此调新境：“十年生死两茫茫”与“会挽雕弓如满月”皆为此调名作。","body":null,"refs":"《钦定词谱》；龙榆生《唐宋词格律》","categoryName":"名篇","createdAt":"2026-11-06 09:09:35","updatedAt":"2026-11-06 09:09:35","related":[{"id":"cul-ci","name":"宋词","cat":"culture"},{"id":"lit-jiangchengzi-mizhou","name":"《江城子·密州出猎》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"lit-jiangchengzi-yimao","name":"《江城子·乙卯正月二十日夜记梦》","cat":"literature"},{"id":"ppl-sushi","name":"苏轼","cat":"people"}],"sources":[{"source":"wikipedia","lang":"zh","title":"江城子","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B1%9F%E5%9F%8E%E5%AD%90","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","revision_id":94144324,"qid":"Q11134092","confidence":1.0,"extract":"江城子，词牌名。亦称《江神子》。单调三十五字或双调七十字，前后阕格式相同，各五平韵，一韵到底。唐时本为单调，宋人将其改为双调。","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:29:49"}]}